---
title: oojresume
description: A build system for generating modular, declarative LaTeX resumes.
date: 2025-10-12
href: https://github.com/ujaandas/oojresume
image: ../../assets/images/projects/oojresume/image.png
---
Tailoring resumes for different roles - like switching emphasis between systems engineering, ML research, or general software engineering-usually turns into a maintenance mess. You either duplicate monolithic `.tex` files and let bullet points drift out of sync, or drown in fragile LaTeX macros.

**oojresume** treats resumes like modular software components. It decouples career metadata from visual styling, letting you define content declaratively and compile multiple targeted PDF variants through a hermetic build pipeline.
